The main sequence establishes explanation/evidence distinctions, allocation-game benchmarks and broader utility before reciprocity and cooperation. Trust branches from sequential UG reasoning; the simultaneous PD branch can enter independently after its own-payoff diagnostic. Warm glow joins utility-motive discrimination and PD incentives. Organization can be executed as an independent orientation branch at any time; its final index position does not defer necessary exam-tool information, which is already in every lesson’s conditions. Ready prerequisite evidence waives only the focused prerequisite check, never this objective’s full acquisition.

## Execution and assessment contract

Every lesson has outcome components, focused diagnostics with keys/repair routes, definitions/intermediate derivations, worked examples, supported completion, two full fresh independent acquisition checks, a fresh correction task, two full delayed alternatives, rubrics/critical errors, advancement and escalation rules. Each I/D question and key jointly covers all essential components. The only acquisition route is I1 AND I2 with two separate current-criterion unassisted passes; diagnostic/W/S/C/D items are not substitutes. Correction supports repair. If either I has been exposed/used unsuccessfully and no fresh required route remains, request plan variants via plan_issue rather than inventing or recycling questions.

Independent practice mirrors the supplied closed-book restrictions: blank paper and pen only; no notes, calculator, device, AI or hint/key access. Delayed checks are separate and at least 24 actual hours after both qualifying acquisition and the most recent relevant teaching/feedback/known solution exposure; measure from the later anchor. They occur before recap, independently and fresh. D1/D2 are reserved for delayed checks; elapsed/exposure unknown cannot certify retention. Recall alone sets dates. Task labels distinguish parallel numeric variants from bounded changed-context discrimination; neither proves untaught transfer. No learner evidence, learning log, recall state, due date or external task is created.

